WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.400
My pace, my pace...

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.260
I'm going on ahead!

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.150
It's okay, it's okay.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.570
The hardworking tortoise will outrun the napping hare.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.070
But...

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.660
What if the hare doesn't like to nap?

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.480
No way...

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.630
No way!

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:59.050
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.060
Everyone, vote for me!

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.850
Now I shall win.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:09.980
Just kidding.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.280
The Level 4 Exam is DODODODODO-!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.500
I never would have guessed.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.210
Onpu-chan's a witch apprentice too.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.670
And she used such magic.

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:41.090
If I had known about it, I would have used magic too.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.120
You idiots!

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:50.020
If you had used such magic, it would have been terrible!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.730
What would have happened?

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.900
Something truly scary.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:59.990
Will it be like tryin' to heal wounds or bringin' the dead back to life with magic?

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.950
Yes, magic that can control other people's minds is forbidden in the Witch World.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.990
What if you've already used it?

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.710
Then something even scarier will happen.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.920
Like what?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.380
Like I said, something very scary!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.090
So just what is it?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.880
So you don't know.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.090
What was that?

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.090
You made us listen while being all serious.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:27.970
But what if Onpu-chan didn't know that was forbidden magic?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.520
You three.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.740
We don't know what will happen, but it can't be good.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.640
Do you have time to be worrying about others?

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:40.020
Yeah, let's tell her tomorrow.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.360
The level 4 exam is tomorrow.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.450
Are you girls even listening to me!?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.240
Good morning!

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:50.700
Ah!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:51.710
There she is!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.000
Onpu-chan!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.130
Good morning!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.450
Ya alright, Doremi-chan?

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.970
Looks like we can't talk to her during recess.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.720
Senoo.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.740
Yes?

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:11.960
Why don't you try the third question?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:12.980
Okay...

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.940
So class time is no good, either.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.910
In the end, we couldn't tell her.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:26.070
Well we can't jus' say it in front of everyone.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:26.700
Yeah.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.870
Bye-bye!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.790
Chance!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.210
Onpu-chan!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.140
Can we talk to you for a second?

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.620
We got somethin' to tell ya.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:39.300
What is it?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.760
Well, not right here...

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.460
That's fine...

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.840
But my ride is here.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.220
I'm a very busy person, that's why.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.890
Well then, see you tomorrow.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.730
Onpu-chan, wait!

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.230
Good night.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.070
Okay, good night.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.040
I asked Doremi-chan to wake me up,

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.500
but that was really stupid of me.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:20.250
I'll drink this entire thing, since I have to take the test tonight in the Witch World.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.470
What are you doing with that coffee?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:28.430
You won't be able to sleep if you drink that.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.890
That's exactly why I want to drink it...

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.450
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.830
Okay, now I have to wake Pop.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.780
Doremi-chan.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.450
Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.330
We're here to help ya wake Pop-chan up.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.080
Thank you.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.220
Okay then, let's start.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:10.850
They're late!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.390
What are they doing!?

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.930
You're late!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.690
I'm sorry.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.230
It's 'cause of Pop-chan.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.770
Don't say anything.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.530
I can just picture it now...

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.030
Okay then, let's go.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.320
Alright!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.200
Listen up.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.620
You have to be careful during the level 4 exam.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.780
We'll try our best.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.870
Alright, let's go to the Witch World!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.750
Hey!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.130
You're late...!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.380
We're sorry, we're sorry!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.640
Well then, let's start the test.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.540
Please.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.600
Okay...

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:57.350
So what kind of test is it this time?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.740
Let's see...

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:01.980
It's that, right...?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.690
Yes, that, that...

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.070
So what is it already?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.030
Don't be in such a rush...

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.250
Yes...

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:12.840
We'll prepare it right now...

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.910
Here we...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.370
Go...!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:49.720
Mimi?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.570
Rere?

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.780
Don't tell me they're...

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.740
Yes...

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.450
The level 4 exam requires you to be with your fairies...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.130
Let's do our best, Rere.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.390
I'm countin' on ya, Mimi.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.140
Why am I stuck with this one?

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:22.940
I'm the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:30.920
Okay then, let's go to the testing grounds...

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.320
Testing grounds?

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.670
What IS this?

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.630
It's the gallery.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.130
Yeah, we kinda get that...

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.000
Okay then, let's get started...

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.460
Get what started?

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.300
The hare and...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.260
the tortoise...

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:01.270
It's a super obstacle race...!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.940
You'll pass if you beat them.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:10.570
But the ones racing are the fairies...

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.940
The apprentices can only help...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.670
Help?

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:17.360
So we can use magic?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:22.220
You can't use magic to block others or to use your broom...

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:25.250
Any other magic is okay...

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.790
Alright!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.750
This'll be easy since we can use magic!

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.460
We can't be too careless.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.390
Ai-chan's right.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.220
It's fine, it's fine.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.340
I read this story a long time ago.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.930
The hare will take a nap and the tortoise is slow.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.390
So we can't possibly lose.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:57.490
You will run one lap back to the goal here, okay...?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.660
You better not screw this up!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.740
Do your best!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.790
Now then, let's get going...

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.410
Get in position...

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.000
Ready...

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.000
What was that?

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:24.270
Did I not tell you..?

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:30.190
You're looking at the most hardworking hare and the fastest tortoise in the Witch World...

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.560
That's unfair! So unfair!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.870
What's going on?

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.480
Yer kiddin' me...

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.770
We were tricked!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.690
What's that?!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:13.560
A wall?

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.580
What the?

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:22.740
How do we get past this without our brooms?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.030
Listen, Doremi-chan.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.790
We can use magic here.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.250
Oh yeah!

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.000
Then I'll start us off.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:46.030
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.810
Make a hole appear in the wall!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.520
Yes!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:00.740
You okay?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:01.950
Um...

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.700
I can't get through.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.530
What're ya doin'?

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.870
Just go in feet first.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:09.910
Ai-chan?

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.000
Nice idea!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.840
Um, Ai-chan, I don't think this will work.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:24.840
Even if you start with her feet, her head will still get stuck.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.010
Right, right?

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:30.520
Impossible! We have the conviction!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.390
Conviction?

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.230
We ain't gonna lose!

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:42.360
Listen, Ai-chan, I'll just use magic to make the hole a little bit bigger.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.080
Thank you, Ai-chan.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.660
See? She got through.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.120
I think something's wrong here.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.750
Hi! Long time no see.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.380
You're...

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.570
that examiner witch from the level 8 exam.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.720
Bingo!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.430
So what do we do next?

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.600
Here you go.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.390
What's this?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:13.850
Next up is a three-legged race.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.390
With who?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.480
Your fairies, of course.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.150
Okay we're ready now.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.110
C'mon, let's go, Doremi-chan.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.330
Okay! Let's do this!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.370
What are you doing!?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.790
Are they okay?
We have to be in sync!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.040
Maybe.
We have to be in sync!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:39.650
Hare, hare, tortoise, tortoise.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:43.300
One, two, three, four.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:43.870
One, two...

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:48.760
One, two, one, two...

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.730
I told you not to run ahead by yourself!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.020
Hey, I'm talking to you!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.020
What did you say!?

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.570
I knew they would screw up.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.490
Am I going to be like this for the rest of my life?

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.790
No more...!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.210
Hey there!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:22.790
Onpu-chan!

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.960
What are you doin' here?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.010
Majo Ruka sent me here.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.090
She told me to mess up your exam.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.010
Oh, they're so cute!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.720
Are those your fairies?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.970
Yes. Onpu-chan, you should have one too.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:38.730
Yes, mine is named Roro.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.020
Oh yeah.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.020
I haven't seen you with your fairy, Onpu-chan.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:46.190
Oh, we do what we want.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.150
I think she's watching TV now.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.740
Anyway, Onpu-chan.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.700
You were using some very dangerous magic earlier.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.770
Yeah!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:56.660
Like what?

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:03.000
Like magic that heals wounds, or magic that alters people's thoughts.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.880
You'll be punished if you use that kind of magic!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.340
I know that.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.260
Then why!?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.680
I'll be fine.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.680
Majo Ruka gave me a magic charm.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.310
Magic charm?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:18.770
My bracelet will repel bad things like that.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:21.480
That's why I'm okay.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.600
That's not the problem!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:24.980
Wait, Onpu-chan!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:28.360
Anyway, shouldn't you girls worry about your exam?

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.740
I'm going to go shopping in the Witch World, now.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:32.950
Later!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.940
My goodness...

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:38.160
And she still messed us up anyway...

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.710
It's finally the climax...

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.670
They're falling further and further behind...

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.300
Good luck, girls!

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:54.090
At this rate we're going to fail!

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.890
It's too early to throw in the towel!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.470
She's right, Doremi-chan.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.270
They're asleep!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.270
And very soundly.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.440
Hey, didn't I tell you?

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.070
The hare will take a nap, just like I said.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.490
But the tortoise is sleepin' too.

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.030
Let's go on ahead.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:12.990
Nope, I don't think so.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:18.200
Okay, this is the last obstacle.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.120
Just what exactly are we doing?

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:29.130
First, you need to fall asleep, and then inside the garden within your dream, you need to catch a very rare butterfly.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.090
It's a rare butterfly, so it'll be hard to catch.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.930
Quit jokin' around!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.140
How can I sleep just like this?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.060
What should I do?

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.890
I can't sleep without my pillow!

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:47.150
Hadzuki-chan, you too?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.960
Actually, me too.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:50.940
Really?

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.820
But since this is an exam, we hafta try and fall asleep.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.700
Yes. Good night.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.740
Good night.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.960
Ai-chan lied!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:09.920
What should I do!?

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.920
We'll fail at this rate!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.140
Hadzuki-chan!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:21.780
Butterflies!

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:22.850
Help us!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.480
There's so many of them.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:30.320
Didn't she say that they were very rare?

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:32.730
Hey!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.070
Don't fly off!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:38.820
Wait!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.160
Get back here!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.370
Come here!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.160
They're just too fast.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.300
They gotta be cheatin'...

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.350
Yeah really.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.680
We can't win without magic.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:04.350
That's it!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.350
Let's use magic!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.650
Good job, Rere!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.410
Mimi, thanks a bunch!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.920
Well, she finally did something good.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:31.880
Alright!

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.130
We caught the butterflies, so let's go back!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:34.710
Yeah!

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.020
Rere.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.490
Okay, you're good to go.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.160
So we've cleared this obstacle.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.570
Come on, let's hurry.

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:03.950
Alright!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.400
Now we're in the lead.

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:09.180
Let's beat 'em!

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:09.620
Right!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.920
No more!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.840
And this one's still sleepin'.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.590
I can't eat anymore!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.720
Got no choice now.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.090
Wake up!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.390
Majo Rika, Majo Rika!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.850
Doremi and the others are in the lead!

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.100
What did you say!?

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.560
They're coming around the corner.

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:33.730
There they are!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.400
Yes!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.280
They're coming!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.790
They got ahead...

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.700
They did get ahead...

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.070
Go!

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:58.880
Go! Beat them and get my money back!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.260
We're gonna lose at this rate!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.430
You want me to throw you?

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.850
It's our only shot!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.480
Alright...

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:15.940
Dodo...

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:18.180
Go for it!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:19.850
Mimi...

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:20.860
I'm countin' on ya!

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:23.320
Please, Rere!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.930
Who won?

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.230
We did it!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:02.280
Oh? Doremi-chan and the others passed the level 4 exam.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.450
They're pretty good!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.530
Congratulations...

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.500
You all pass...

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.220
Thank goodness!

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.410
You did great!

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.290
Here...!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.790
Spheres of certification...

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.580
Thank you, Mimi.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.260
It's all thanks to you, Rere.

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:32.680
We did it!

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:37.690
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan, let's keep working hard like this.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.520
Yeah!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:39.010
Okay!

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:42.940
Just keep on passing exams like this!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:46.450
If only Pop could too.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.490
Well, Pop is a lost cause.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.120
It ain't easy for her at all.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.920
I have to get to the Witch World this time.

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.700
There's a strong wind blowing in the Witch World.

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:06.270
Ten Witch Frogs were blown into the Human World.

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:07.420
If they get seen...!

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:09.790
Then the secret of the Witch World will be found out!

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:11.350
We need to do something!

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.680
Um, let me take you all out to eat and then to the amusement park.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.800
Ah, how about the hot springs?

00:22:15.800 --> 00:22:18.110
Please go back to the Witch World!

00:22:18.110 --> 00:22:19.180
Yer causin' us a lotta trouble!

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:21.230
You frogs better get going!

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:23.890
Oh yeah, we have to respect our elders.

00:22:23.890 --> 00:22:25.110
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.580
So Many Witch Frogs!

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:29.330
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
